==Description==
The '''Frozen Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained from the [[Krampus' Revenge Event#Gifts|Gift of the North Winds]]. This gift could be gotten from the [[Quests#Christmas Time|Christmas Time]] quest, which was completed by triumphing [[Krampus Frosthold]] once.

The '''Frozen Nametag''' has blue text, dark blue outline and a shining translucent blue background. It also emits white particles.

